Description: Tool to calculate the nutrient input by waterbirds, based on
    the tool Waterbirds v1.1 (2007) from S. Bauwer & S. Hahn, Netherlands
    Institute of Ecology (NIOO-KNAW) and the related publications Hahn et
    al. (2007, Freshwater Biology) and Hahn et al. (2008, Freshwater
    Biology).
